   |
8  |         inout [inout inspected] |parcel| {
   |                      --------- lent `inout` here
14 |     for weight in accepted {
   |                   -------- the loop's next pass takes its next element from this value, which holds the lend
15 |         total += *weight + inspected
   |                            ^^^^^^^^^ this uses the place while it is lent
